<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Movie Review</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #111827;
      color: #f9fafb;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: auto;
      background-color: #1f2937;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #facc15;
      text-align: center;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      width: 250px;
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .rating {
      color: #facc15;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #facc15;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #374151;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main>

    <h1>Rise Beyond</h1>

    <img 
      src="https://cdn.freecodecamp.org/curriculum/labs/rise-beyond-2.png"
      alt="Movie poster for Rise Beyond showing the film's main character">

    <p>
      Rise Beyond is an inspiring adventure about courage, determination,
      and the power of believing in yourself. A young hero faces dangerous
      challenges while fighting to protect the people he loves.
    </p>

    <p class="rating">
      <b>Movie Rating:</b>
      <span aria-hidden="true">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐☆</span>
      (9/10)
    </p>

    <h2>Cast Members</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><b>James Holloway</b> as Ethan Carter</li>
      <li><b>Sarah Mitchell</b> as Olivia Brooks</li>
      <li><b>Daniel Roberts</b> as Marcus Reed</li>
      <li><b>Emily Watson</b> as Sophia Lane</li>
      <li><b>Michael Anderson</b> as David Carter</li>
    </ul>

  </main>

</body>
</html>

